    "description": "Purchase probability + engagement (clicks & timeline) + Brand Brain fit.\n\nSETUP\n1. Start the API:  PORT=3002 python -m uvicorn app:app --host 127.0.0.1 --port 3002\n2. Open this collection's Variables tab and paste your API_KEY (from .env) into `apiKey`.\n3. Run the whole collection (Run collection) — every request carries assertions.\n\nWHAT TO LOOK FOR\n`purchase_probability` is the calibrated model output and is NEVER moved by the layers.\n`lead_priority.score` is the ranking signal (uncalibrated by design) — sort lead lists on it.\nRequest 3 proves both at once: same lead, Brand Brain applied, probability identical, ranking moved.",
